{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Get in touch with {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — integrative wellness guidance and practical care planning.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0f1724;
      --card:#0b1220;
      --accent:#ffbf69;
      --muted:#9aa4b2;
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      --glass-2: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
      --radius:14px;
      --shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6);
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#e6eef6}
    /* patterned header using inline SVG */
    header{
      padding:48px 28px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(14,21,31,0.6), rgba(6,10,14,0.6)), url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="800" height="200" viewBox="0 0 800 200"><defs><linearGradient id="g" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="%23ffcf80" stop-opacity="0.12"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="%23ff9a76" stop-opacity="0.06"/></linearGradient></defs><g fill="none" stroke="%23ffbf69" stroke-opacity="0.06" stroke-width="1"><path d="M0 100C40 50 120 0 200 20s140 80 220 60 140-120 260-40"/></g></svg>') center/cover no-repeat;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      border-bottom-left-radius:28px;border-bottom-right-radius:28px;
    }
    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}
    nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#ff7b7b);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#08203a}
    .brand h1{font-size:18px;margin:0}
    .brand p{margin:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .navlinks{display:flex;gap:14px}
    .navlinks a{color:#cfe6ff;text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px}
    .navlinks a:hover{background:var(--glass)}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start;margin-top:34px}
    .panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--card), rgba(8,12,16,0.85));padding:22px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6)}
    .lead{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 12px}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    input,textarea,select{background:var(--glass-2);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;color:#e9f4ff;font-size:14px}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .btn{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#ff7b7b);border:none;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:12px;color:#07202b;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    /* Proof Gallery */
    .proof{margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start}
    .testi{flex:1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:16px;border-radius:12px}
    .testi p{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px}
    .testi .who{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px}
    .badge{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:6px 8px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;cursor:default;position:relative}
    .tooltip{position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);bottom:120%;white-space:nowrap;background:#07202b;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;color:#e6f9f2;font-size:12px;display:none}
    .badge:hover .tooltip{display:block}
    /* Pricing comparator */
    .pricing-mini{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:14px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .toggle{display:flex;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);border-radius:999px;padding:4px;width:160px}
    .toggle button{flex:1;background:transparent;border:none;padding:8px;border-radius:999px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}
    .toggle button.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.04),rgba(255,255,255,0.02));color:#eaf8ff}
    .price{font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)}
    .price-sub{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    footer{margin-top:26px;padding:28px 20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    /* responsive */
    @media (max-width:880px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .navlinks{display:none}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="wrap">
      <nav>
        <div class="brand">
          <div class="logo">HM</div>
          <div>
            <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
            <p class="small">{{TAGLINE}}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="navlinks">
          <a href="index.html">Welcome</a>
          <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
          <a href="conditions.html">Ailments</a>
          <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
          <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
          <a href="about.html">Story</a>
          <a href="book.html">Schedule</a>
          <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
        </div>
      </nav>
      <div class="hero">
        <div>
          <div class="panel">
            <h2 class="lead">Let's shape a practical plan together.</h2>
            <p class="muted">Reach us to explore personalized consultations, short series, and supporting add-ons. We'll respond with options, availability, and next steps.</p>
            <div style="height:12px"></div>
            <form id="contactForm" class="small" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();handleSubmit();">
              <label>Name <input id="name" name="name" placeholder="Your full name"></label>
              <label>Email <input id="email" name="email" placeholder="you@domain.com"></label>
              <div class="row">
                <input id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="Phone or text (optional)">
                <select id="reason" name="reason">
                  <option value="general">General inquiry</option>
                  <option value="new">New client intake</option>
                  <option value="follow">Follow-up / ongoing</option>
                  <option value="retail">Retail / supplements</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <label>Message <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Briefly describe what you're hoping for..."></textarea></label>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:6px">
                <button class="btn" type="submit">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
                <div class="small">Or book a time: <a href="book.html" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">Open scheduling</a></div>
              </div>
              <p class="small" style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)">By contacting us you agree to receive messages regarding scheduling and services. For urgent issues, call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong>.</p>
            </form>
          </div>

          <div class="panel" style="margin-top:14px">
            <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px">Proof & trust</h3>
            <div class="proof">
              <div class="testi" id="testi">
                <p id="quote">"A thoughtful guide who helped me see small steps that fit my life — I could act on them right away."</p>
                <div class="who" id="who">— A. R., professional</div>
                <div class="badges">
                  <div class="badge" data-tip="Board-certified training for integrative clinicians">
                    NCCAOM
                    <div class="tooltip">Board-certified training for integrative clinicians</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="badge" data-tip="Member: Integrative Practice Network">
                    IPN
                    <div class="tooltip">Member: Integrative Practice Network</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="badge" data-tip="Community-vetted care partners">
                    Community Partner
                    <div class="tooltip">Community-vetted care partners</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:10px" class="small">Rotate testimonials: <button id="prev" class="small">◀</button> <button id="next" class="small">▶</button></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside>
          <div class="panel pricing-mini">
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
              <div>
                <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Quick cost view</div>
                <div class="price" id="price">$120</div>
                <div class="price-sub" id="sub">/ session</div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="toggle" role="tablist" aria-label="Pricing toggle">
                  <button id="monthlyBtn" class="active" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Monthly</button>
                  <button id="packageBtn" role="tab">Package</button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="small" style="color:var(--muted)">
              Toggle between single-session pricing and an example 3-session package with a bundled discount.
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:8px;align-items:center">
              <button class="btn" onclick="location.href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'">Get a plan</button>
              <button class="btn" style="background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);color:#eaf8ff" onclick="location.href='book.html'">Book a consult</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="panel" style="margin-top:14px">
            <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px">Reach out directly</h4>
            <div class="small">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
            <div class="small">Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
            <div class="small" style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)">Location: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap" style="padding:28px 20px">
    <section class="panel" style="display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column">
      <h3 style="margin:0">What to expect after you reach out</h3>
      <p class="muted" style="margin:0">We’ll reply with options for an initial conversation (short intake or a full consult), available times, and a transparent fee outline. If you are exploring package options or add-on supports (supplement guidance, movement referrals), we include that in the reply.</p>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:12px;width:100%">
        <div style="background:var(--glass);padding:12px;border-radius:10px">
          <strong>Short Intake</strong>
          <div class="small" style="color:var(--muted)">30–45 min. Orientation and goal-mapping.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--glass);padding:12px;border-radius:10px">
          <strong>Renewal Session</strong>
          <div class="small" style="color:var(--muted)">60 min. Deep-dive, plan, and resources.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--glass);padding:12px;border-radius:10px">
          <strong>Foundations Package</strong>
          <div class="small" style="color:var(--muted)">3 sessions + tailored resources and check-ins.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Note: Our guidance is educational and supportive. We do not provide emergency care or guaranteed outcomes. For medical emergencies seek immediate help.</div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:14px" class="panel">
      <h3 style="margin:0">Community notes</h3>
      <p class="muted">We work with people across many conditions and life stages. If you'd like more specific information before a first chat, indicate the topic in your message and we will include resources relevant to your situation.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:10px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <span style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:8px;border-radius:10px">Menopause support</span>
        <span style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:8px;border-radius:10px">Digestive care</span>
        <span style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:8px;border-radius:10px">Sleep & rhythm</span>
        <span style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:8px;border-radius:10px">Chronic fatigue management</span>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="wrap">
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <div class="small">© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Holistic & integrative guidance. All communications are educational only.</div>
      <div class="small">Made with care. <a href="privacy.html" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">Privacy</a></div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // testimonial gallery data
    const testimonials = [
      {quote: 'The plan felt possible. The check-ins kept me honest and curious.', who: '— M. L., teacher'},
      {quote: 'Practical, kind, and framed for my life — not a generic list of things.', who: '— D. K., parent'},
      {quote: 'Helped me see what mattered most and replace overwhelm with doable steps.', who: '— S. P., engineer'},
      {quote: 'Careful listening, followed by clear, evidence-aware suggestions.', who: '— J. T., nurse'}
    ];
    let idx = 0;
    const quoteEl = document.getElementById('quote');
    const whoEl = document.getElementById('who');
    const prevBtn = document.getElementById('prev');
    const nextBtn = document.getElementById('next');
    function show(i){
      idx = (i + testimonials.length) % testimonials.length;
      // simple fade animation
      quoteEl.style.opacity = 0;
      whoEl.style.opacity = 0;
      setTimeout(()=>{
        quoteEl.textContent = '"' + testimonials[idx].quote + '"';
        whoEl.textContent = testimonials[idx].who;
        quoteEl.style.opacity = 1;
        whoEl.style.opacity = 1;
      },220);
    }
    prevBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>show(idx-1));
    nextBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>show(idx+1));
    // auto-rotate
    let rotateTimer = setInterval(()=>show(idx+1),6000);
    // pause on hover
    const testiWrap = document.getElementById('testi');
    testiWrap.addEventListener('mouseenter',()=>clearInterval(rotateTimer));
    testiWrap.addEventListener('mouseleave',()=>rotateTimer = setInterval(()=>show(idx+1),6000));

    // simple tooltip content set from data-tip (already in place)
    document.querySelectorAll('.badge').forEach(b=>{
      b.addEventListener('mouseenter',()=>{
        const tip = b.getAttribute('data-tip');
        const tt = b.querySelector('.tooltip');
        if(tt) tt.textContent = tip;
      });
    });

    // Pricing comparator
    const monthlyBtn = document.getElementById('monthlyBtn');
    const packageBtn = document.getElementById('packageBtn');
    const priceEl = document.getElementById('price');
    const subEl = document.getElementById('sub');
    const PRICES = {monthly:120, packageTotal:330}; // package = 3 sessions at a slight discount

    let animFrame = null;
    function animatePrice(from,to,duration=550){
      const start = performance.now();
      cancelAnimationFrame(animFrame);
      function step(t){
        const p = Math.min(1,(t-start)/duration);
        const eased = 1 - Math.pow(1-p,3);
        const val = Math.round(from + (to-from)*eased);
        priceEl.textContent = '$' + val;
        if(p<1) animFrame = requestAnimationFrame(step);
      }
      animFrame = requestAnimationFrame(step);
    }

    monthlyBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{
      monthlyBtn.classList.add('active'); packageBtn.classList.remove('active');
      subEl.textContent = '/ session';
      animatePrice(parseInt(priceEl.textContent.replace(/[^0-9]/g,'')) || PRICES.packageTotal, PRICES.monthly);
    });
    packageBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{
      packageBtn.classList.add('active'); monthlyBtn.classList.remove('active');
      subEl.textContent = '/ 3-session pack';
      animatePrice(parseInt(priceEl.textContent.replace(/[^0-9]/g,'')) || PRICES.monthly, PRICES.packageTotal);
    });

    // form handling (local demo only)
    function handleSubmit(){
      const name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
      const email = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
      const message = document.getElementById('message').value.trim();
      if(!email || !name){
        alert('Please provide your name and email so we can reply.');
        return;
      }
      // show quick confirmation
      alert('Thanks, ' + name + '! We received your message and will reply to ' + email + '.');
      document.getElementById('contactForm').reset();
    }

    // footer year
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // initialize view
    show(0);
    // start price default
    priceEl.textContent = '$' + PRICES.monthly;
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# Contact Page (chunk 4)

This bundle contains the contact page and a README for the holistic_medicine site.

Files:
- contact.html — Full standalone contact page. Includes:
  - Responsive header and navigation linking to other pages in the site.
  - Contact form (demo/local submission) using placeholders: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.
  - Proof Gallery: rotating testimonials and credibility badges with tooltips (pure JS).
  - Pricing Comparator micro-widget: toggles Monthly vs Package with animated number transitions.
  - Educational disclaimer and accessible contact details.

Notes:
- No external assets are required. The header uses an inline SVG pattern for visual interest.
- The contact form is a local demo — replace handleSubmit() to integrate with a backend or form service.
- Placeholders should be replaced by the integrating system.

How to use:
- Drop contact.html into the site folder alongside other pages.
- Ensure other pages referenced in the nav exist (index.html, services.html, conditions.html, approach.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html).
- Replace placeholders with real values and wire up form submission as needed.

Design/UX:
- Bold, playful layout with a warm storyteller tone.
- Widgets implemented with vanilla JS for portability and easy customization.

License: provided as-is for integration into the holistic_medicine project.
"} 
BUNDLE_END
